  "about": "Two-player demo level 2, The decoy (B-054), in co-op: won with both monks in play, the players moving at the same time. The monks chase the nearest player. Player 1 is the decoy: it climbs to the top floor and waits for the monks, leads them over the bar, digs a hole behind itself on the top floor, takes the top right gold, goes down to the middle floor and traps a monk in a second hole, then again in a third hole on the bottom floor. Meanwhile player 2 takes the gold on the right of the middle floor, the bottom floor's gold and the gold on the left of the middle floor, traps the monk that comes down for it, walks over it to the top left gold, then drops from the bar onto the two gold under it and touches the exit.",
